OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABritish rapper Yung Filly to face rape
OL,4,Aretrial in Australia next June
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fan, aged 20 at the time, alleges
OL,7,FBarrientos repeatedly raped and
OL,8,Fassaulted her in his hotel room in
OL,9,FPerth, Western Australia, after a 2024
OL,10,Fconcert.
OL,12,FThe court previously heard that
OL,13,FBarrientos and the woman had consensual
OL,14,Fsex before she alleged it turned
OL,15,Fviolent and he refused to stop.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
